  m_name: The Sailjelly
  m_entryIndex: 186
  m_fullBodyIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d84659b76fc2ff4a80482691bf6c5de, type: 3}
  m_description: "A colossal jellyfish fused with the remains of a sailing ship.
    Its translucent body carries a torn organic sail, while rope-like tentacles drag
    anchors, bones, and wreckage through the water.\n\nIt attacks by electrifying
    the surrounding sea before dragging prey beneath the waves. Its greatest weakness
    is the sail itself\u2014damaging it makes the creature unstable and vulnerable.
    It is also highly vulnerable outside the water."
